      <marc:subfield code="a">Demonstrates common signs that babies can use to communicate, including &quot;bath,&quot; &quot;more,&quot; &quot;all done,&quot; and &quot;help.&quot;
Simple sign language is a proven bridge between baby talk and first English, and here&apos;s the clearest way to learn it. With pull tabs that demonstrate exactly how to make each sign, My First Baby Signs teaches parents and babies eight essential words. Just pull the tab, point to the moving sign, and say the word. Your baby will be signing in no time</marc:subfield>
